invariant: INV-38
file: srv_flight.c
catches: srv_flight_test
reason: the server sets ch_tls.limit_sent for an EncryptedExtensions that
  carries no record_size_limit, so a legal client record its buffer cannot
  hold gets record_overflow for a limit this server never sent. Camilo
  ruled internal_error there (docs/decisions.md 166). bin/srv_flight_test
  reads limit_sent after each EncryptedExtensions.

--- old
    t->limit_sent = h->record_size_limit != 0; // what io_read_record reads (io.h)
--- new
    t->limit_sent = 1; // what io_read_record reads (io.h)
